] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">No</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Sides</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Single side</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Typical use</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">School bench models PDS-SB 801 to PDS-SB 815 for schools and educational institutions.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"colgroup\" colSpan=\"2\" class=\"bg-subtle/80 px-4 py-2 text-left text-[0.75rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">Ordering</th></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Ordering</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Price on request — contact the Plusmark order desk</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Custom sizes</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Made to order</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-sizes\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-sizes-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-sizes\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-sizes-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 l